## Design App Details Wiring

In Design app, the right-side **Details** content is built in one `useEffect` inside the Design root component. It inspects current selection and registers sections dynamically with `addSection("details", ...)`.

```37224:37300:compose/sketchpad/index.tsx
useEffect(() => {
  const selectionPieceEntries = (selection.pieces || []) as any[];
  const selectionConnectionEntries = (selection.connections || []) as any[];
  // resolve selected piece/connection IDs...
  const hasPieces = selectedKnownPieceGuids.length > 0;
  const hasConnections = selectedConnections.length > 0;
  const hasPortSelected = primaryConnector !== undefined;
  const hasSelection = hasPieces || hasConnections || hasPortSelected;

  removeSection("details", "compose.sketchpad.app.design.properties");
  removeSection("details", "compose.sketchpad.app.type.connector.properties");
  // remove old piece/connection sections...

  if (!hasSelection) {
    addSection("details", { id: "compose.sketchpad.app.design.properties", content: () => <DesignSection /> });
  } else if (hasPortSelected) {
    addSection("details", { id: "compose.sketchpad.app.type.connector.properties", content: () => <ConnectorSection .../> });
    addSection("details", { id: "compose.sketchpad.app.design.properties", content: () => <DesignSection /> });
  } else {
    if (hasPieces) addSection("details", { id: piecesSectionId, content: () => <PiecesSection /> });
    if (hasConnections) addSection("details", { id: connectionsSectionId, content: () => <ConnectionsSection connections={selectedConnections} ... /> });
    addSection("details", { id: "compose.sketchpad.app.design.properties", content: () => <DesignSection /> });
  }
```

So:  
- no selection -> Design properties  
- piece selection -> Piece section (+ design props)  
- connection selection -> Connection section (+ design props)  
- connector selection -> Connector section (+ design props)

