## How To Change Data (Clear Examples)

### A) Change design-level fields (name, unit, location, etc.)
`DesignSectionForm` uses `kitCommands.updateDesign(design.guid, diff)`.

```31277:31337:compose/sketchpad/index.tsx
const updateDesignField = (diff: any) => { kitCommands.updateDesign(design.guid, diff); };

<Input ... id="...design.name" onLazyChange={(value) => updateDesignField({ name: value })} />
<Input ... id="...design.unit" onLazyChange={(value) => updateDesignField({ unit: value })} />
```

Example:
- rename design -> `updateDesignField({ name: "Tower A" })`
- set unit -> `updateDesignField({ unit: "m" })`

### B) Change piece data
Piece detail controls call `commands.updatePiece(origin, pieceGuid, diff)`.

```17282:17394:compose/sketchpad/index.tsx
commands.updatePiece("...piece.center.u", pieceScope.guid, { center: { u: value, v: piece.center?.v ?? 0 } });
commands.updatePiece("...piece.scale", pieceScope.guid, { scale: value });
commands.updatePiece("...piece.name", pieceScope.guid, { name: value });
```

Example:
- set piece scale to 2 -> `updatePiece(..., pieceGuid, { scale: 2 })`
- set piece color -> `updatePiece(..., pieceGuid, { color: "#ff0000" })`

### C) Change connection data
Connection detail controls call `commands.updateConnection(origin, connectionGuid, diff)`.

```17465:17590:compose/sketchpad/index.tsx
commands.updateConnection("...connection.gap", connectionScope.guid, { gap: value });
commands.updateConnection("...connection.rotation", connectionScope.guid, { rotation: value });
commands.updateConnection("...connection.description", connectionScope.guid, { description: value || undefined });
```

Example:
- move connection in diagram -> `updateConnection(..., connectionGuid, { u: 12.5, v: -3 })`
- rotate -> `updateConnection(..., connectionGuid, { rotation: 45 })`

### D) Programmatic API entrypoint
Use `useDesignAppCommands()`.

```29639:29694:compose/sketchpad/index.tsx
const commands = useDesignAppCommands();
commands.updatePiece(origin, pieceGuid, pieceDiff);
commands.updateConnection(origin, connectionGuid, connectionDiff);
commands.addPiece(origin, piece);
commands.addConnection(origin, connection);
```

